{"name": "Heroes of the Triangle: Mask Rush", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CALL YOUR \"FRIENDS\" FOR A BEATDOWN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players brawl for the legendary Lunara Mask! Fight your buddies with honor or play dirty in this chaotic clash \u2014 perfect for pizza night!<br/><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/fd913f125a3779687ccad83e9ffe3efa.poster.avif?t=1786049976\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/fd913f125a3779687ccad83e9ffe3efa.webm?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/fd913f125a3779687ccad83e9ffe3efa.mp4?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>NEW STAGE, NEW CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As if backstabbing buddies weren\u2019t enough, each level throws in a new dynamic! Show off your platform skills while dodging deadly lasers or surviving a ravenous, platform-devouring tornado! Master each layout and use it to your advantage!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/b66b7c3d02a29a8ee4abe499cab15afc.poster.avif?t=1786049976\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/b66b7c3d02a29a8ee4abe499cab15afc.webm?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/b66b7c3d02a29a8ee4abe499cab15afc.mp4?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br/><br/><strong>PLAY REMOTELY WITH YOUR FRIENDS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes of the Triangle: Mask Rush is compatible with <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>! With the press of a button, play with your friends as if you were sharing the same couch \u2014 and even better, only one person needs to own a copy of the game!<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/89102919c4a85b50bb8100e0a91f1adc.poster.avif?t=1786049976\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/89102919c4a85b50bb8100e0a91f1adc.webm?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/89102919c4a85b50bb8100e0a91f1adc.mp4?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TIRED OF BRAWLING? TIME FOR SPORTS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form teams and face off in frantic matches of soccer or basketball! Not really into sports? No worries \u2014 you can still smack your buddies around and mess up the game! <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/504256454fb22c98b14b940ea114caf7.poster.avif?t=1786049976\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/504256454fb22c98b14b940ea114caf7.webm?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/504256454fb22c98b14b940ea114caf7.mp4?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>FROM SAMURAI TO DRAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a diverse and charismatic cast of characters and leave your opponents in the dust with as much style as possible!<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/ed08c2b230a761202fd7c563ccf7ffc3.poster.avif?t=1786049976\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/ed08c2b230a761202fd7c563ccf7ffc3.webm?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/ed08c2b230a761202fd7c563ccf7ffc3.mp4?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>SIMPLE CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This party\u2019s for everyone! With simple, intuitive controls, you don\u2019t need to be a Twitch champion to have fun in this wildly inviting chaos. At the same time, platforming veterans will find a rich stage to showcase their skills and flow across the screen with speed and style.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/b9c711bfb5c350aca700fb602cf4e661.poster.avif?t=1786049976\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/b9c711bfb5c350aca700fb602cf4e661.webm?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/b9c711bfb5c350aca700fb602cf4e661.mp4?t=1786049976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attention:</strong><br/>- Local and Remote multiplayer only (No online multiplayer)<br/>- Gamepad required (Only one player can use the keyboard)</p> </div>", "short_desc": "In this chaotic party platformer, you must hold onto the sacred Lunara Mask as long as you can, while your rivals try to beat it out of your hands. Move with agility to chase down or escape from your opponents, and sabotage their attacks with precise parries. Who can complete this hilarious ritual?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/e4627835b782ea2558d8525e2bc653f437459bea/header.jpg?t=1786049976", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Party Game", "Platformer", "2D Fighter", "4 Player Local", "Local Multiplayer", "2D Platformer"], "developers": "Hype Entertainment", "publishers": "Hype Entertainment", "release_date": "Aug 6, 2026", "price": "$5.99", "appid": "3709180", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 February 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Jz6sosQNuv8", "first_seen": 1770591600.0, "review_rank": 1240}